flowchart TD
  Prospect["Hotel buyer problem discovery and competition research"]
  ICP{"Relevant operational loss and budget owner?"}
  NotYet["Disqualify or maintain permissioned followup"]
  Wait["Explicit early access consent with evidence"]
  Demo["Real demo: guest enquiry to human case; no fake booking"]
  Pilot["Written scoped pilot with responsible hotel operator"]
  Track["Baseline: enquiries, time-to-accept, resolutions, cost"]
  Value{"Verified measured benefit and willingness to pay?"}
  Redesign["Improve workflow or choose another problem"]
  Contract["Approved service contract, pricing, SLA and DPA"]
  Deploy["Secure hotel onboarding and staged release"]
  Cost["Worthkind MRR/ARR, Meta/voice/AI/infra costs separately"]
  Outcome["Hotel-reported service quality and PMS-confirmed GMV separately"]
  Prospect --> ICP
  ICP -->|"No"| NotYet
  ICP -->|"Yes"| Wait --> Demo --> Pilot --> Track --> Value
  Value -->|"No"| Redesign --> Prospect
  Value -->|"Yes"| Contract --> Deploy
  Deploy --> Cost
  Deploy --> Outcome
